:: Library Apesai (browse) [unfinished]

{=

(metadata:
"title", "Browsing the Apesai Library",
"cardDesc", "The search is half the joy. Now, you'd be properly joyful if you //actually// find something of use.",
"img", "https://fallenlondon.wiki/w/images/8/83/University.png",
"parent", "S: Library Apesai",
"devNote", [Write the ?browseContent text. And of course, write code.failure code and text],
)

$cssColumnParent[

$cssColumnChild[
	$cssBox[
    	($funcImage: (passage:)'s img)
         $cssBoxItem[''(print: (passage:)'s title )''<br>(print: (passage:)'s cardDesc)]
    ]
]

$cssColumnChild[
<!--format attendant lines-->
($funcNPCSpeakManual: "genericAttendant2")
(set: _line to (hook: "genericAttendant2Line"))

<!--content begins-->
Rolling up your sleeves, fastening the loose hem of your clothes, covering up your face, and steeling your nerves, you march into that dust-filled library - the battlefront of the mind.
<br>
_line["Browse at your leisure,"] the spider chirps as you leave it. _line["(either: "Keep in mind that we do not have a borrowing program. So plan your study time accordingly.", "But remember: All documents are considered property of the davehkhan and thereby of Nurandah. Take appropriate care.", "Do be mindful of other students and scholars. Do not hoard books.")"]
<br>
[{}]<browseContent|
---
<ol>

|browseAction>[
<!--Save list to $stuffDaily to prevent the browse list from being cleared-->

<!--initialize browseList and browseAllowance-->
(if: $stuffDaily does not contain "browseList")[(set: $stuffDaily's browseList to (a:))]
(if: $stuffDaily does not contain "browseAllowance")[(set: $stuffDaily's browseAllowance to 6)]

<!--standard action text-->
(set: _browseLinkText to "Search the library shelves.")
<!--if still allowed-->
(if: $stuffDaily's browseAllowance > 0)[
<li>(link-rerun: _browseLinkText)[{
     <!--subtract browse allowance-->
     (set: $stuffDaily's browseAllowance to it -1)
     
     <!--roll dice-->
     (set: _browseDice to (random: 1,100))

     <!--Success-->
     (if: _browseDice >= 80)[(display: "code.libraryApesaiSuccess")]
     <!--Failure-->
     (else:)[Failure TEXTTTTTT!]

     <!--refresh ?browseBox-->
     (t8n: "dissolve")(rerun: ?browseBox)(rerun: ?browseAction)
}]</li>]<!--end of if still allowed-->

<!--if disallowed-->
(else:)[<li>~~_browseLinkText~~ $cssDesc[(You have breathed in enough dust and are done browsing for today.)]]<!--end of if disallowed-->

]<!--end of ?browseAction-->



What you've found...
<br>
(box:"X", 10)+(bg: "#524538")[
($funcReadingList: $stuffDaily's browseList)
]<browseBox|
<br>


Actually...
<li>(link: "Enough of this.")[{
     (goto: "S: Library Apesai")
}]</li>

</ol>

<!--content ends-->
]<!--end child-->
]<!--end parent-->